 "words_heard": 159,
 "words": 164,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Whoever believes in me will do the works",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And even greater things than these",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because I am going to the Father now",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whatever you ask in my name",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will do so the Father is glorified",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the Son, I promise you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you ask me anything in my name",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will do it, trust me now",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you love me you will keep my commandments",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I will ask the Father for you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will give you another Advocate",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I'll never forget to be with you, forever true",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit of truth whom the world cannot receive",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because it neither sees him nor knows him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But you know him for he remains with you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And will be in you, deep within",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you love me you will keep my commandments",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I will ask the Father for you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will give you another Advocate",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To be with you forever true",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will not leave you as orphans",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am coming to you soon",
   "heard": 6,
